          <pre><code>npx proof-of-commitment --file package-lock.json</code></pre>

          <p>
            Or try the browser demo at <a href="/audit?packages=glob,cross-spawn,inherits,once,chalk">getcommit.dev/audit</a>
            &mdash; the five invisible packages above, scored live.
          </p>

          <p>
